---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="About René Dohmen">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-8 gradient-text">About Me</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 mb-8">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Hi, I'm René Dohmen, CEO of <a href="https://www.formatics.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-orange hover:text-amber-500">Formatics</a> 
          and a passionate developer with a deep love for Linux, open source, music, and motorcycles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>What I Do</h2>
      <p>
        I lead Formatics, where we build innovative software solutions. My technical background spans
        full-stack development, DevOps, and system architecture. I'm particularly passionate about:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Python and modern web frameworks (Django, FastAPI)</li>
        <li>Linux system administration and automation</li>
        <li>Open source software and contributing to the community</li>
        <li>Building scalable, maintainable applications</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Beyond Code</h2>
      <p>
        When I'm not writing code or running a company, you'll find me:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>🎸 Making music and exploring new sounds</li>
        <li>🏍️ Riding motorcycles (proud Suzuki VX800 owner!)</li>
        <li>🐧 Tinkering with Linux systems and experimenting with new tech</li>
        <li>📚 Learning and sharing knowledge through this blog</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why This Blog?</h2>
      <p>
        I started this blog to document my journey, share solutions to problems I've encountered,
        and contribute back to the tech community that has taught me so much. You'll find posts
        about programming, Linux, development workflows, and occasionally my other interests.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        Feel free to connect with me on <a href="https://github.com/acidjunk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> 
        where I share open source projects and contributions.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-orange/10 border border-orange/30 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-center text-lg mb-4">
          Thanks for visiting! I hope you find something useful or interesting here.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center">
          <a 
            href={`${base}blog/`} 
            class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-orange text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all"
          >
            Check out the blog
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
